| Anti-Pattern | A commonly used solution that leads to bad design or maintenance problems |

---

**2. Goal**

| Pattern | Anti-Pattern |
|---|---|
| Improve scalability | Causes technical debt |
| Encourage loose coupling | Creates tight coupling |
| Improve maintainability | Makes code hard to maintain |

