Supplier<String> s = () -> "Hello";

// Consumer → consumes data (no return)
Consumer<String> c = str -> System.out.println(str);
```

---

## 2. Method

```java id="sc2"
// Supplier
T get();

// Consumer
void accept(T t);
```

---

## 3. Input / Output

```java id="sc3"
// Supplier → () -> T
String val = s.get();

// Consumer → T -> void
c.accept("Hello");
```

---

## 4. Usage Example

```java id="sc4"
