### 1. Basic URL Shortener (Base62 Encoding 🔥)
```java id="url1"
import java.util.*;

class UrlShortener {

    private static final String BASE62 =
            "abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ0123456789";

    private Map<String, String> shortToLong = new HashMap<>();
    private int counter = 1;

    public String encode(String longUrl) {
        String shortKey = toBase62(counter++);
        shortToLong.put(shortKey, longUrl);
        return "http://short.ly/" + shortKey;
    }

    public String decode(String shortUrl) {
        String key = shortUrl.substring(shortUrl.lastIndexOf("/") + 1);
        return shortToLong.get(key);
    }

    private String toBase62(int num) {
        StringBuilder sb = new StringBuilder();

        while (num > 0) {
            sb.append(BASE62.charAt(num % 62));
            num /= 62;
        }

        return sb.reverse().toString();
    }
}
```

