Here are **industry-level ways** to find the **intersection point of two linked lists** 👇

---

### 1. Two Pointer (Most Important 🔥 O(n+m), O(1))
```java id="ip1"
public class IntersectionLL {

    static class Node {
        int val;
        Node next;
        Node(int v) { val = v; }
    }

    static Node getIntersection(Node a, Node b) {
        if (a == null || b == null) return null;

        Node p1 = a, p2 = b;

        while (p1 != p2) {
            p1 = (p1 == null) ? b : p1.next;
            p2 = (p2 == null) ? a : p2.next;
        }

        return p1; // intersection node or null
    }
}
```

