### 4. Stack Based (Extra Space ⚠️)
```java id="rm4"
import java.util.*;

static Node remove(Node head, int n) {
    Stack<Node> stack = new Stack<>();
    Node curr = head;

    while (curr != null) {
        stack.push(curr);
        curr = curr.next;
    }

    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {
        curr = stack.pop();
    }

    if (stack.isEmpty()) return head.next;

    Node prev = stack.peek();
    prev.next = curr.next;

    return head;
}
```

