### 6. Using Recursion
```java id="st6c2l"
public class StringToInt {

    public static void main(String[] args) {
        String str = "1234";
        System.out.println(convert(str, 0));
    }

    static int convert(String str, int index) {
        if (index == str.length()) return 0;

        int digit = str.charAt(index) - '0';
        return digit * (int)Math.pow(10, str.length() - index - 1)
                + convert(str, index + 1);
    }
}
