Here are **industry-level implementations** of **Maximum Subarray Sum (Kadane’s Algorithm)** 👇

---

### 1. Standard Kadane’s Algorithm (Most Important 🔥)
```java id="kd1k9x"
public class Kadane {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        int[] arr = {-2, 1, -3, 4, -1, 2, 1, -5, 4};

        int maxSum = arr[0];
        int currentSum = arr[0];

        for (int i = 1; i < arr.length; i++) {
            currentSum = Math.max(arr[i], currentSum + arr[i]);
            maxSum = Math.max(maxSum, currentSum);
        }

        System.out.println(maxSum);
    }
}
```

---

### 2. Handle All Negative Numbers (Safe Version)
```java id="kd2p7m"
public class Kadane {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        int[] arr = {-5, -2, -8};

        int maxSum = Integer.MIN_VALUE;
        int currentSum = 0;

        for (int num : arr) {
            currentSum += num;

            if (currentSum > maxSum) {
                maxSum = currentSum;
            }

            if (currentSum < 0) {
                currentSum = 0;
            }
        }

        System.out.println(maxSum);
    }
}
