## ⚡ Serializer Performance Comparison

| Serializer | Speed 🚀 | Size 📦 | Readability 👀 | CPU Cost 🔥 | Use Case |
|------------|--------|--------|--------------|------------|----------|
| `StringRedisSerializer` | ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ | ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ | ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ | ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ | Simple values |
| `JdkSerializationRedisSerializer` | ⭐⭐ | ⭐ | ❌ | ⭐⭐ | Legacy only |
| `Jackson2JsonRedisSerializer` | ⭐⭐⭐ | ⭐⭐⭐ | ⭐⭐⭐⭐ | ⭐⭐⭐ | Typed JSON |
| `GenericJackson2JsonRedisSerializer` | ⭐⭐⭐ | ⭐⭐⭐ | ⭐⭐⭐⭐ | ⭐⭐⭐⭐ | Most used |
| `ByteArrayRedisSerializer` | ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ | ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ | ❌ | ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ | Raw performance |
| Kryo (custom) | ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ | ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ | ❌ | ⭐⭐⭐⭐ | High-performance systems |
