### 🚀 Kryo Serializer (Super Fast)
```java id="k0gmbg"
Kryo kryo = new Kryo();
Output output = new Output(new ByteArrayOutputStream());
kryo.writeObject(output, user);
byte[] bytes = output.toBytes();
```

