### Kafka Streams Logic (Moving Avg)

```java id="g4h9xg"
@Configuration
public class StockStreamProcessor {

    @Bean
    public KStream<String, String> process(StreamsBuilder builder) {

        KStream<String, String> stream = builder.stream("stock-prices");

        stream
            .mapValues(value -> Double.parseDouble(value.split(",")[1]))
            .groupByKey()
            .windowedBy(TimeWindows.ofSizeWithNoGrace(Duration.ofSeconds(5)))
            .aggregate(
                () -> 0.0,
                (key, value, agg) -> agg + value,
                Materialized.with(Serdes.String(), Serdes.Double())
            )
            .toStream()
            .map((windowedKey, value) ->
                KeyValue.pair(
                    windowedKey.key(),
                    windowedKey.key() + ",AVG:" + value
                )
            )
            .to("processed-prices");

        return stream;
    }
}
```

