## ⚡ Production Improvements (very important)

```js
// 1. Use eachBatch instead of eachMessage (better performance)
consumer.run({
  eachBatch: async ({ batch, resolveOffset, heartbeat }) => {
    const records = [];

    for (let message of batch.messages) {
      records.push(JSON.parse(message.value.toString()));
      resolveOffset(message.offset);
    }

    await saveToDB(records);
    await heartbeat();
  }
});
```

