## 🚀 Single Runner (core logic)

```java id="runner4"
@Component
public class AppRunner implements CommandLineRunner {

    private final List<Job> jobs;

    public AppRunner(List<Job> jobs) {
        this.jobs = jobs;
    }

    @Override
    public void run(String... args) {
        if (jobs.isEmpty()) {
            throw new RuntimeException("No job found for active profile");
        }

        jobs.forEach(Job::run); // 🔥 runs only active profile job
    }
}
```

