## 🔥 Pro Upgrade (optional: job name based execution)

```java id="runner5"
@Component
public class AppRunner implements CommandLineRunner {

    private final Map<String, Job> jobMap;

    public AppRunner(Map<String, Job> jobMap) {
        this.jobMap = jobMap;
    }

    @Override
    public void run(String... args) {
        String jobName = System.getProperty("job.name");

        if (jobName == null || !jobMap.containsKey(jobName)) {
            throw new RuntimeException("Invalid job.name");
        }

        jobMap.get(jobName).run();
    }
}
```

